-LITRE-1-150x150.jpg 150w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/10-LITRE-1-100x100.jpg 100w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/10-LITRE-1.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dc7a959 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"dc7a959\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-690bb51 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"690bb51\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8f3df99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8f3df99\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Basınçlı boya kazanları</strong>, boya, vernik ve kaplama malzemelerini <strong>basınç altında depolayan ve doğrudan püskürtme sistemine besleyen</strong> profesyonel boya ekipmanlarıdır. Bu kazanlar, özellikle geniş yüzey boyama, seri üretim hatları ve yüksek hacimli projelerde <strong>daha dengeli, verimli ve daha hızlı boya uygulaması</strong> sağlar.</p><p>HD Marine basınçlı boya kazanları; <strong>yüksek iş hacmi</strong>, <strong>homojen boya akışı</strong>, <strong>daha az duraklama süresi</strong> ve <strong>düşük hatalı uygulama</strong> avantajı ile endüstriyel tesisler, atölyeler ve marin boya işlemleri için ideal çözümler sunar.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e502de1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e502de1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db7fffc elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"db7fffc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBasınçlı Boya Kazanlarının Teknik Özellikleri\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0e84c25 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0e84c25\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"514\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"185\">Özellik</td><td width=\"329\">Değer</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Ürün Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Basınçlı Boya Kazanı</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Kapasite</td><td width=\"329\">10 – 120 L</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Maksimum Basınç</td><td width=\"329\">7 – 20 bar</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Malzeme</td><td width=\"329\">Paslanmaz Çelik / Alüminyum</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Kapak Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Sızdırmaz T lid / Kelepçeli</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Giriş / Çıkış Bağlantısı</td><td width=\"329\">½” – 1¼” BSP</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Uygulama Alanı</td><td width=\"329\">Endüstriyel &amp; Marin Boya</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Aksesuarlar</td><td width=\"329\">Basınç göstergesi, emiş filtresi</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Kullanım Sıcaklığı</td><td width=\"329\">-10°C – +60°C</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e061af8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e061af8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cdfc264 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cdfc264\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9dedab0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9dedab0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-080f5d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"080f5d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Basınçlı Boya Kazanlarının Avantajları</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2516b9f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2516b9f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>✔ <strong>Dengeli boya akışı:</strong> Basınçlı depo sayesinde her an eşit boya transferi<br />✔ <strong>Yüksek verim:</strong> Büyük hacimli boya ihtiyacı olan projeler için uygun<br />✔ <strong>Daha hızlı uygulama:</strong> Seri üretim hattı ve yüksek yüzey alanlarında ideal<br />✔ <strong>Dayanıklı yapısı:</strong> Paslanmaz çelik ve profesyonel tasarım<br />✔ <strong>Kolay temizlik:</strong> Emme filtresi ve geniş ağız sayesinde bakım kolaylığı</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-86a074a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"86a074a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-318e487 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"318e487\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-6a24b4ed65d73\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-318e487\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-d9bc4456a24b4ed65d73\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-d9bc4456a24b4ed65d73\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-d9bc4456a24b4ed65d73\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Basınçlı boya kazanı nedir?</span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-arrow-circle-down\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"ht